+  //   2. Rearms |c|'s trap.
+  //   3. Writes to |d| to eventually activate |c|'s trigger again.
+  //
+  // Meanwhile, |b|'s event handler removes |c|'s trigger altogether before
+  // writing to |c| to activate |d|'s trigger.
